{"id":2316,"date":"2016-04-26T11:32:40","date_gmt":"2016-04-26T10:32:40","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/microclub.ch\/?p=2316"},"modified":"2016-06-27T17:40:57","modified_gmt":"2016-06-27T16:40:57","slug":"spectre-lumineux-de-lampes-de-technologies-differentes","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/2016\/04\/26\/spectre-lumineux-de-lampes-de-technologies-differentes\/","title":{"rendered":"Spectre lumineux de lampes de technologies diff\u00e9rentes"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>Lors d&rsquo;une d&rsquo;une conf\u00e9rence \u00ab\u00a0microprojets\u00a0\u00bb, je vous avais pr\u00e9sent\u00e9 4 technologies diff\u00e9rentes d&rsquo;ampoules d&rsquo;\u00e9clairage. Je m&rsquo;\u00e9tais concentr\u00e9 sur la consommation d&rsquo;\u00e9nergie.<\/p>\n<p>Plusieurs membres du club m&rsquo;avaient alors \u00e9mis quelques doutes sur la qualit\u00e9 d&rsquo;\u00e9clairage notamment sur la nocivit\u00e9 lumineuse de certaines technologies.<\/p>\n<p>J&rsquo;ai donc effectu\u00e9 des mesures de spectres des 3 technologies utilis\u00e9es actuellement. J&rsquo;ai utilis\u00e9 un spectrom\u00e8tre d&rsquo;<a href=\"http:\/\/www.gmp.ch\/spectroscopy\/spectrometer\/ocean-optics-usb2000-miniature-fiber-optic-spectrometer\">ocean optique<\/a>\u00a0qui m&rsquo;a \u00e9t\u00e9 mis \u00e0 disposition par la soci\u00e9t\u00e9 <a href=\"http:\/\/www.gmp.ch\/\">GMP SA<\/a>.\u00a0\u00a0Ce spectrom\u00e8tre nous des valeurs comprises entre 200 et 1100 nm, sachant que le domaine visible est compris entre 380 et 750 nm.<\/p>\n<p>Voici donc les r\u00e9sultats :<\/p>\n<p><strong>1 Ampoule halog\u00e8ne<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><a href=\"http:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/04\/Halogenep-1.jpg\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-2318\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-2318\" src=\"http:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/04\/Halogenep-1.jpg\" alt=\"Halogenep\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" \/><\/a><\/p>\n<p><a href=\"http:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/04\/SpectreHal.jpg\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-2319\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-2319\" src=\"http:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/04\/SpectreHal-300x233.jpg\" alt=\"SpectreHal\" width=\"300\" height=\"233\" srcset=\"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/04\/SpectreHal-300x233.jpg 300w, https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/04\/SpectreHal-768x596.jpg 768w, https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/04\/SpectreHal-1024x794.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/04\/SpectreHal.jpg 1060w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Ce spectre pr\u00e9sente une courbe r\u00e9guli\u00e8re avec une forte proportion de rouge.\u00a0La lampe \u00e9met beaucoup de chaleur (rayonnement infrarouge =\u00a0IR).<br \/>\nLe spectre d&rsquo;une ampoule incandescente classique est similaire, avec un d\u00e9calage un peu plus marqu\u00e9 vers le rouge.<\/p>\n<p>On voit aussi qu&rsquo;il n&rsquo;y a pas d&rsquo;\u00e9mission d&rsquo;UV.<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p><strong>2 Lampe \u00e9conomique (fluo compacte)<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><a href=\"http:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/04\/EcoP.jpg\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-2320\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-2320\" src=\"http:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/04\/EcoP.jpg\" alt=\"EcoP\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" \/><\/a><\/p>\n<p><a href=\"http:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/04\/SpectreFluo-1.jpg\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-2322\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-2322\" src=\"http:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/04\/SpectreFluo-1-300x232.jpg\" alt=\"SpectreFluo\" width=\"300\" height=\"232\" srcset=\"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/04\/SpectreFluo-1-300x232.jpg 300w, https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/04\/SpectreFluo-1-768x594.jpg 768w, https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/04\/SpectreFluo-1-1024x792.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/04\/SpectreFluo-1.jpg 1060w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/a><\/p>\n<p>On remarque que le spectre\u00a0est peu homog\u00e8ne et montre des pics qui correspondent \u00e0 l&rsquo;\u00e9mission des atomes de mercure lors des d\u00e9charges lumineuses.<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p><strong>3 Lampe LED<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><a href=\"http:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/04\/LED-blanc-chaudp.jpg\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-2323\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-2323\" src=\"http:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/04\/LED-blanc-chaudp.jpg\" alt=\"LED blanc-chaudp\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" \/><\/a><\/p>\n<p><a href=\"http:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/04\/SpectreLED.jpg\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-2324\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-2324\" src=\"http:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/04\/SpectreLED-300x239.jpg\" alt=\"SpectreLED\" width=\"300\" height=\"239\" srcset=\"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/04\/SpectreLED-300x239.jpg 300w, https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/04\/SpectreLED-768x613.jpg 768w, https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/04\/SpectreLED-1024x817.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/04\/SpectreLED.jpg 1090w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Spectre d&rsquo;une lampe LED avec une temp\u00e9rature de couleur de 2700\u00b0K. On remarque qu&rsquo;il n&rsquo;y a pas ou peu d&rsquo;infra-rouge donc pas de d\u00e9gagement de chaleur.<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p>Laurent Francey\u00a0 24 avril 2016<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Lors d&rsquo;une d&rsquo;une conf\u00e9rence \u00ab\u00a0microprojets\u00a0\u00bb, je vous avais pr\u00e9sent\u00e9 4 technologies diff\u00e9rentes d&rsquo;ampoules d&rsquo;\u00e9clairage. Je m&rsquo;\u00e9tais concentr\u00e9 sur la consommation<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":4,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"colormag_page_container_layout":"default_layout","colormag_page_sidebar_layout":"default_layout","footnotes":""},"categories":[166],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-2316","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-microclub"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/2316","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/4"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=2316"}],"version-history":[{"count":2,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/2316\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":2347,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/2316\/revisions\/2347"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=2316"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=2316"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=2316"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}